  "sn2.27:1.1": "ṭhito kho Nando devaputto Bhagavato santike imaṃ gātham abhāsi || || ",
  "sn2.27:2.1": "Accenti kālā tarayanti rattiyo || ",
  "sn2.27:2.2": "vayoguṇā anupubbaṃ jahanti || ",
  "sn2.27:2.3": "etaṃ bhayaṃ maraṇe pekkhamāno ",
  "sn2.27:2.4": "puññāni kayirātha sukhāvahānīti || || 2. ",
  "sn2.27:3.1": "Accenti kālā tarayanti rattiyo || ",
  "sn2.27:3.2": "vayoguṇā anupubbam jahanti || ",
  "sn2.27:3.3": "etaṃ bhayaṃ maraṇe pekkhamāno || ",
  "sn2.27:3.4": "lokāmisaṃ pajahe santipekkho ti || || 1. Ekam antaṃ "
